#import "/.shared/typst/utp.typ": *

#labquestion(1)[Keep the CRM record linked][
  On the opportunity for Seri Iskandar Cycling Club, schedule a follow-up activity and enter the five-bike requirement in an internal note. Create the quotation from this opportunity.
]

#labanswer[
  #strong[Inspect the result.] The opportunity links to the quotation, and both identify the same customer and salesperson.
]

#labquestion(2)[Inspect the quotation arithmetic][
  Add Road Bike, quantity 5, unit price RM 1,000 and no discount for the classroom example. Check the untaxed subtotal before confirmation.
]

#labanswer[
  #strong[Inspect the result.] Untaxed subtotal is RM 5,000. Record any configured taxes separately: with Malaysia’s default 10% tax, the quotation also shows RM 500 tax and RM 5,500 total. Expected CRM revenue is not a posted accounting revenue.
]
